B.EA=new A.br(B.akV,["Task City","My city","Today","Tonight",'New task\u2026 e.g. "call the dentist"',"Add","Nothing open. Add a task and watch a floor appear.","done this week","windows lit","of","All","Later","Built today","Delete","Undo","Added: {t}","Added {n} tasks: {t}","Added by voice: {t}","Task deleted","Progress in ","quiet for 5 days","Day","Night","\u05e2\u05d1\u05e8\u05d9\u05ea","Sign in","Create account","Sign out","Email","Password","Show","Continue without an account","Save your city","Sign up or sign in to start: your city is kept safe, on every device.","I already have an account","New here? Create an account","That did not work. Check the email and password and try again.","Check your inbox to confirm the email, then sign in.","Forgot password","Check your email","We sent a 6-digit code to ","Confirm","Didn't get it? You can resend in ","Didn't get it? Send a new code","We sent a new code","Fix the email address","That code did not work, or it has expired. Try again or ask for a new one.","New password","Enter the code we sent to "," and choose a new password.","New password","At least 6 characters","Save and sign in","Back to sign in",'Type your email above, then tap "Forgot password" again.',"We could not send the email. Check the address and try again in a minute.","Saved to your account","Saved on this device only","today","tomorrow","When","No date","New task","Edit task","Neighbourhood","Project (a building)","No project","New project",'e.g. "Kitchen renovation"',"Pick a date","Repeat","Once","Every day","Every week","Every month","Reminder","None","Pick a time","Save","Details","Projects","Inbox","in the inbox","Morning plan","Good morning \xb7 one minute to plan","What goes into today?","Star up to 3 main tasks","Up to 3 main tasks a day","Let's go","for today","Evening summary","Built in the city today","steps","Still open","Tomorrow","Other date","All to tomorrow, good night","Postponed {n} times. Break it into a small first step?","Break it up","First step: ","Main tasks of the day","Morning","Afternoon","Evening","Any time","Got {n} tasks","Tap a detail to change it","Add {n} tasks","Cancel","Quick picks","Time","Note or link","Main task","Done","15 more min","Listening\u2026","Voice is not available here. Use the keyboard mic.","Nothing left open. Well done.","All your tasks,\nmade easy.","One place for everything you need to do, with reminders on time and a city that shows your progress.","Step {n} of 5","Who is the city for?","You can change this in settings any time.","Just me","My own city","Together, as a couple or a home","One city for two","Family with kids","Coming soon","What will you call your city?","The name sits at the top of your home screen.","City name","My city","Taskville","Our home","What is the first thing you will finish?","Something small for today. It starts your first building.","Or write your own","Call the dentist","Study for the test","Maths homework","Make the slides for the meeting","Email the client","Buy milk","Pack my bag for tomorrow","Answer one message","Tidy the closet","A 20-minute run","Pay the electricity bill","Get started","Continue","Build my city","Today","Week","{day} is busy ({n}). Long-press a task and drop it on a lighter day.","Long-press a task to move it to another day","Nothing planned.","Weekly summary","This week the city grew {n} steps","Best day","Most done in","Plan next week","worth a visit","A quiet week. One small task tomorrow gets things moving.","City","Level","tasks to the next level","Top level","Progress","Week","Calendar","No time:","Moved to {t}","Google Calendar","Connecting\u2026","Synced with Google","Connected. Tasks with a time now appear in the SkyTasks calendar in Google.","Could not connect to Google Calendar. Try again in a moment.","Google sync failed","All day","(no title)","My calendars","Not connected","Your classes and meetings, right here","SkyTasks reads the calendars already on your phone and adds your tasks with a time to them. It all stays on the phone.","Connect my calendars","Not now","The phone did not allow calendar access. You can allow it in the phone settings, under SkyTasks.","What shows in the calendar","All your calendars are ticked, except SkyTasks: your tasks already show.","Done","No calendars found on this phone.","On this phone","Where tasks with a time go","Moved or renamed there, the task follows. Deleted there, the task stays, without a time.","{n} calendars","1 calendar","Show my phone's calendars","Events from the calendars on your phone (Google, iCloud, Outlook) show beside your tasks, and tasks with a time go into the calendar you pick. Nothing from your calendar is saved on our server.","Export my tasks","A file with all your tasks: name, date, time, neighborhood and what is done. It is made on this device, and you save or send it from there.","Table (CSV)","Opens in Excel and Google Sheets","Export a table","Calendar file (.ics)","Goes into any calendar: Google, Apple, Outlook","Export to a calendar","Include tasks that are done","{n} tasks","No tasks to export yet.","Could not make the file. Try again in a moment.","Task","Date","Time","Neighborhood","Project","Done","Repeats","Note","Yes","Created in SkyTasks","Sent {n} tasks with a time to the SkyTasks calendar in Google.","tasks done in the last 7 days","Most active:","The days ahead","Nothing planned","Tasks","Profile","Lot","Foundations","Under construction","Finished","Full of life","Office tower","House","Playground","Clinic","School","Bank","Supermarket","Family house","All tasks","New task here\u2026","What needs doing?","open","done","this week","Evening look","Account","Tap a building to see its tasks","No tasks here yet. Add the first one.","Work","Home","Family","Health","Study","Money","Settings","Reminder before a task","On time","Off","Minutes before. A task without a time gets no reminder.","Daily habits","Morning plan","Evening summary","Weekly summary, Saturday night","Weekly summary, Sunday","Tap a time to change it. A switched-off screen still opens from the Tasks tab.","Language and display","Day and night","Automatic","Always day","Always night","The week starts on","Sunday","Monday","Who lives in the city","A real shared home is coming soon. For now this is only saved.","Edit","City name","Privacy policy","Terms of use","By creating or opening an account you accept the |terms of use| and the |privacy policy|.","Report a bug","Check for a new version","Your version: {v}","You have the latest version.","Loading the new version\u2026","A new version of the app is out.","Refresh","Could not check right now. Try again in a moment.","Versions to try","The main version","You are in a test version: {v}","Report a bug","What happened? What did you expect to happen?","Sent straight to the SkyTasks team, with the app version and device type. Your tasks are not sent.","Send","Thanks! The report was sent.","Could not send. Check the connection and try again.","Not signed in \xb7 this phone only","Delete account and city","Delete the city","Delete the city?","Your account, {n} tasks{p} and every building will be deleted from the server and from this phone. They cannot be restored.","{n} tasks{p} and every building will be deleted from this phone. They cannot be restored.","To confirm, type {w}","DELETE",", {n} projects","Delete forever","Could not delete. Check the connection and try again.","Time to plan the day","Pick what goes into today.","How did today go?","Close the day and move what is left.","Your week in the city","See what you built this week.","now","in {n} min","at {t}","Your city is waiting for you","Everything is where you left it. {n} tasks are waiting, and one small one is enough to come back.","Everything is where you left it. One task is waiting.","Everything is where you left it. What is next?","Nothing set for today","What goes into today? Tap to plan.","Today: one task","Today: {n} tasks","First at {t}: {title}","Top of the list: {title}","Day closed","Next","Nothing left today. Good night, city.","{n} of {n} done. Tap to see the city at night.","{d} of {n} done. {left}","One is waiting for a decision.","{n} are waiting for a decision.","{n} tasks done this week.","Still open. Mark it done or move it?","{b} is now level {n}","{n} tasks done \xb7 {d}","First task \xb7 {d}","{p}: building finished","{n} tasks","{n} of {n} tasks","The office tower","The house","The playground","The clinic","The school","The bank","The supermarket","The family house","The shop","The studio","The garden","The tower","More notifications","A task whose time passed","Your city is quiet","An hour after a task that is still open, and after 3 days away. At most 3 a day with the morning and evening ones; task reminders always ring.","Pick up Noa from practice","What's new","Version {n}","{a} of {b}","Next","To the city","Skip","Dentist","A living city, and you in it",'Between the buildings there are now roads with traffic lights, a bus that stops at its stop and people crossing at the zebra. And there is you: the figure in the yellow cap stands by your next task, and after "Done" walks to the one after.',"One home for two",'Invite your partner with a WhatsApp link. Each of you keeps your own city, and one neighbourhood is shared: "Our home", with a window in each person\'s colour. When a task is given to you, you get a notification. You both need an account.',"Reminders and celebrations","Each morning, what waits today, and an hour after a task that is still open, one nudge. When the day is done, a small bar slides down and the building glows. Every kind can be turned off in Settings.","Events in the calendar",'In the calendar tab, press and hold an hour and drag: an event with a start and an end. A sentence like "Meeting tomorrow 10 to 11" becomes one too. Events go to Google Calendar, and they are not tasks: nothing to tick, nothing built.',"Lunch with Dan","Your day on the home screen","Five new widgets: today, what is next, your city, progress and quick add. Tick a task without opening the app. To add one, press and hold the home screen and choose Widgets.","Pay the electric bill","Buy milk","Pick up Noa","Call grandma","A new tasks tab",'On top, the next three hours, the first one with "Done". Below it, what has no set time, by neighbourhood. Swipe right to finish a task and left to move it to tomorrow. Meetings stay in the calendar.',"Your calendars, right here","Classes, shifts and meetings from the calendars on your phone (Google, iCloud, Outlook) show in the calendar tab, and a task with a time goes into your calendar too. Move or rename a meeting right here, pick a calendar for each task, event, lesson or exam, and your timetable goes into the calendar as weekly lessons. Connect them in the calendar tab.","Something is on in the city","Every few days there is a market or a festival in the city, and on holidays a hanukkiah in the square. Tap it, and everyone heads there.","Focus mode","Walk into your city","Two fingers turn the city and tilt it down to the street; pinch to come close. Tap a building to fly to it, double-tap to land by its door. Up close: curtains, faces, and your next task on a sign over the door.","Three ways to lay out your city","The grid, a square with a fountain, or the old city with a plaza and gates. The same city, buildings and tasks; only the layout changes. Settings \u2192 My neighbourhoods.",'One task on the screen with a small first step, a timer that builds a building while you work, and reading aloud. "Too hard" gives an even smaller step. Turn it on in Settings, under Focus.',"The city speaks",'Reminders come from the building of your neighbourhood: "From the clinic: dentist". And there are small sounds when you finish a task or tap the city. Turn them off in settings; on silent they stay quiet.',"That email address does not look right. Check it has an @ and a dot.","The password is too short. Use at least 6 characters.","Wrong email or password. If you signed up with Google, use the Google button.","This email already has an account. Enter its password to sign in.","Too many tries. Wait a minute and try again.","No internet connection. Check it and try again.","Google sign-in did not work. Try again, or use your email.","or","Continue with Google","Continue with Apple","Skip","{n} of {m}","Build my city","Your timetable and exams","Fill in your timetable once: lessons come back every week and skip the holidays. An exam gets a countdown and study sessions in your free hours, and each one builds a floor of your school.","Maths exam \xb7 6 days to go","Floor 1 of 3","Write it the way you say it","One sentence, and the task finds its place in your city: the day, the time and the neighbourhood fill in by themselves. You can also just say it.","Dentist tomorrow at 10","Health \xb7 tomorrow 10:00","Every task builds your city","Each part of your life has a neighbourhood and a building. A finished task takes it up a level, and at night the windows light up. Two fingers turn the city and take you down to its streets.","The office, level 3","Reminded right on time","A reminder comes before each task, and you can tick it done or push it right from there. A short plan in the morning, a look back in the evening.","Dentist","In 15 min \xb7 10:00","One calendar for everything",'Classes and meetings from the calendars on your phone show by day, 3 days, week or month, and a task drops into a free hour. Invite your partner to a shared neighbourhood, "Our home".',"Calendar \xb7 Lecture 10:00 \xb7 Free 2:30","Noa added: buy milk","Feature guide","See the tour again","5 pages, about a minute","A task or an event?","Task: something to do",'You tick it "done", and it builds your city. It can have a time, or just a day, or neither. In the calendar it takes half an hour unless you give it a length.',"Event: time that is taken",'A lecture, a meeting, a party: a start and an end in the calendar. Nothing to tick and it does not build, it only keeps the hours. Drag over the hours in the calendar, or write a range: "meeting 10 to 11".',"The basics","More you can do","Try it","Add with a sentence or your voice",'"Dentist tomorrow at 10", and it is set.',"A city that grows","Every finished task takes a building up a level.","Reminders and daily habits","A reminder before each task, a morning plan and an evening look back.","Calendar and events","Day, 3 days, week or month, with your phone's calendars; drag a task to a free hour, or over the hours for an event.","Our home","A shared neighbourhood for couples, with a WhatsApp invite.","Repeating tasks and projects",'"Every Tuesday", and projects that rise as buildings of their own.',"every Tuesday ","The week, and moving tasks","Press and hold a task, then drag it to another day.","Neighbourhoods of your own","Up to 3, with your own name, building and words.","Widgets and sharing","Your tasks on the home screen, and WhatsApp text that becomes a task.","Press and hold an empty spot on your home screen, tap Widgets and pick SkyTasks. To share, select text in WhatsApp, tap Share, then SkyTasks.","This week","Next week","Earlier week","Later week","Widgets","Today and what is next on the home screen, and your progress on the Lock Screen.","Press and hold an empty spot on your home screen, tap Edit, then Add Widget, and pick SkyTasks. For the Lock Screen, press and hold it, tap Customize, then the space under the clock. Widgets need iOS 17 or later.","Your day on the home screen, now on iPhone","New widgets: today's tasks and what is next, and on the Lock Screen, what is next and your progress. Tap a circle to mark a task done without opening the app. To add one, press and hold the home screen, then tap Edit.","Got it","Task","Event","e.g. Meeting with the accountant","Save to calendar","Add task","Delete","Reminder {n} min before","Reminder when it starts","No reminder","Apple sign-in did not work. Try again, or use your email.","New account","I have one","Connect Google Calendar too?","Tasks with a time go to a separate calendar called SkyTasks, and come back here if you move them there. Your other calendars stay untouched.","Connect the calendar","Not now","Signed in as {e}","tasks done","days you built","Waiting for you","Focus","Focus mode","One task on the screen, a 2-minute first step, a timer that builds, and reading aloud.","Large, roomy text","Every text in the app gets bigger.","On","Off","Now","First step","Step {a} of {b}","A smaller step","{n} min","Done, next step","Done","Too hard, a smaller step","The whole task is done","Tap to start","{t} left","Paused \xb7 {t}","Time is up. Another round, or done.","{n} more today","Hide the rest of today","Read aloud","There is no English voice on this phone. You can add one in the phone settings, under text-to-speech.","What should the city help you with?","Pick as many as you like.","Studies and exams","Work and projects","Home and family","Focus, attention and getting organised","Just running my day","One task on the screen, a 2-minute first step, a timer that builds a building, and reading aloud. You can turn it off in settings.","city level","Your city is only on this phone","New phone? It would be gone. Saving it takes a second.","Save","Reminders","{n} min before","Account","Help and bug reports","Google Calendar","Connected","Not connected","Tasks with a time appear in a calendar called SkyTasks in your Google Calendar, and changes there come back here.","Sync now","Disconnect","Off","This is how it will look","Not signed in","An account keeps your city safe and on every device.","Got it:","When","Time","Repeats","Area","Main","Weekend","Next week","Other\u2026","Which neighbourhood?","Pick a date\u2026","Project","Steps","Add a step","Saved as you go","Filter","{a} of {b}","{a} of {b} done","The next hours","All in the calendar","To do today","No set time \xb7 whenever suits you","Past its time","Later","Done today {n}","One more and level {n}","{b} \xb7 level {n}","Today is free","Still waiting without a date:","Tap one to move it to today","{a} of {b}. Every window is lit.","Tomorrow: {n} tasks, the first at {t}","Tomorrow: {n} tasks","Done","See","City sounds","Free camera in the city","Two fingers turn the city and tilt it down to the street. Off: pan and zoom only, as before.","City style","Neighbourhoods","The same city, buildings and tasks. Only the layout changes.","Grid","Two crossing roads","Square","A fountain in the middle","Old city","A plaza with gates","Choose this style","That's your city's style","Back","Top view","Street","Rate us","Short, soft sounds when a task is done, a building grows or you tap the city. Silent when your phone is.","Market day in the square","Stalls in the square, and everyone is on the way","A festival at the playground","Balloons, music, and the whole neighbourhood comes","Rain over the city","Umbrellas out. The square stays busy","Hanukkah in the square","One more candle tonight","Purim in the city","Costumes and balloons in the streets","Passover in the city","Spring, and a festive table in every home","Happy new year from the city","A sweet year to every neighbourhood","Sukkot in the city","Stalls in the square and guests in every sukkah","Good morning. Two minutes to plan the day?","How did today go? Close the day","Your week in the city is ready","Later on","Now","Next","Moved {n} times","Moved once","Done \u2713","+15 min","Shopping","My neighbourhoods","A hidden neighbourhood is not offered when you add a task, and the city shows a park in its place. Its tasks stay, and you can bring it back any time.","A neighbourhood of your own","Your neighbourhood","What is it called?","The dog, the business, the garden\u2026","Which building?","Colour","Words that send tasks here (optional)","A word, then Enter","It goes up in the new quarter, plot {n} of 3, and grows a level with every task you finish.","Create the neighbourhood","Delete the neighbourhood","Delete {name}?","{n} tasks move to Home. No task is deleted.","Shop","Studio","Garden","Tower","Add a neighbourhood of your own","Your own neighbourhoods","Up to 3 of your own","They stand in a new quarter across a new road, which opens with the first one.","New","Daily plan and summary","Our home","The {name} family","Invite someone",'Invite your partner. "Our home" and its supermarket are shared; the rest of your city stays yours.',"A shared home needs an account, so both phones see the same tasks.","Family name (optional)","Levi","It hangs on a sign over the gate.","Living here","you","Someone else","Invite on WhatsApp","Copy the invite","Invite copied","Or a code to type in, good for 24 hours","I have a code","6 digits","Join","An invite from {name} to a shared home","An invite to a shared home",'Shared: "our home" and its shopping list.',"Yours alone: work, health and the rest of your city.","A notification comes when a task is given to you.","Sign in to join",'You live together now: "our home" stands in the new quarter.',"My name here","Leave the shared home","The home and its tasks stay with the others. What was yours to do goes to your own home neighbourhood.","Leave","That code is wrong or no longer valid. Ask for a new one.","Too many tries. Try again in an hour.","This home is full: up to 6 people.","You already live in a shared home. Leave it first, in settings.","Something went wrong. Check the connection and try again.","An invite from {name} to our shared home in SkyTasks \ud83c\udfe1\n{link}\nOr type the code {code} in Settings \u203a Our home.","Shared home","For","Whoever gets to it","Me","Done by {name}","Back","Timetable","Timetable settings","Kind","School, by period","University, by hour","until {d}","Tap a cell to add a lesson. Lessons repeat every week until the end of the year, and skip the holidays by themselves.","Holidays are skipped by themselves. Other breaks: the sliders icon above. A tap on a lesson in the calendar can cancel it for one day.","Free","New lesson","Change the lesson","period {n}","Subject, e.g. Maths","Room (optional)","Lecture","Practice","Lab","Seminar","Add lesson","A name for the board: 11th grade 3, semester A\u2026","School days","Sun\u2013Thu","Sun\u2013Fri","Mon\u2013Fri","From when until when","Bell times","Add a period","Breaks by hand","Holidays are already skipped. Add anything else: a trip, a strike, your own semester break.","Break","Name (optional)","Add dates","Not set up","{n} lessons","Exams","Exam","No exams ahead. Add one, and the app proposes when to study for it.","days","{s} exam","{d} of {n} study sessions","This exam is gone.","Change the exam","Done","Today!","1 day to go","{n} days to go","Floor {d} of {n}","What to study","The chapters, the pages, what the teacher said\u2026","Delete the exam","The exam goes from the calendar. Its building and the study sessions stay in the city.","Subject, e.g. Maths","until","Add exam","Proposed study sessions","Study sessions","{n} proposed","The days before the exam are full. Add a study session by hand, or move something.","No study sessions.","Put it in the calendar","Put all {n} in the calendar","I will pick the hours myself","Add a study session","Study for the {s} exam","Session {k} of {n}","Built","Planned","Study session","Proposed","{n} min","How long","Day","3 days","Week","Month","{w}: no lessons","Hold and drop on an hour","No lesson today","To the timetable","Free","Open the day","Exam","Break","Holiday","Nothing on this day yet.","Calendar","Default calendar","Another calendar\u2026","Which calendar?","Main","Meeting","From the calendar {c}","Save to the phone's calendar","Add a task from this","The phone did not let the change through. Try again, or change it in the calendar app.","Exam","Rosh Hashanah","Yom Kippur","Sukkot","Hanukkah","Purim","Passover","Independence Day","Lag BaOmer","Shavuot","Calendars by link","Paste an iCal address from Google Calendar, Outlook, Moodle or your school, and its events show here, read only, on every device.","Add a calendar by link",'Google Calendar: Settings \u2192 the calendar \u2192 "Secret address in iCal format". Outlook: Settings \u2192 Shared calendars \u2192 Publish. Moodle: the calendar export. Paste the address here. It stays on this device.',"Name (optional)","Add","That is not a calendar link. It should start with https:// or webcal://.","Added. Its events show in the calendar.","Could not read this calendar. Check the link, and that you are signed in.","Calendars by link need an account: sign in first.","Remove this calendar?","Timetable and exams","Your lessons on a board, repeating every week and skipping the holidays. An exam gets a countdown and study sessions in your free hours.","Focus mode","One task, a small first step and a timer, when it is hard to start.","Walk into your city","Turn the city, tilt down to the street and come close.","City style","The grid, a square or the old city: the same city, laid out another way.",'Two fingers turn it and zoom. Drag up or down to tilt. Tap a building to fly to it, or tap twice on the ground to drop to the street. "Up" takes you back.',"A task by voice, without opening the app","A SkyTasks button on the Lock Screen, in Control Centre or on the Action button.",'Lock Screen: press and hold it, tap Customise, tap a button in a bottom corner and pick SkyTasks, "Task by voice". Control Centre: swipe down, press and hold, Add a Control, SkyTasks. Action button: Settings, Action Button, Controls, SkyTasks. Tap it, say the task, and it is in. Needs iOS 18; allow the microphone in the app once.',"Colour","The area's","Own","Last week","Delete the meeting?",'"{t}" will be deleted from your calendar on the phone, and from every device it syncs to.',"A calendar you shape with a finger","Hold a task without a time and drop it on a free hour. Drag a task to another hour or day, and pull its foot to make it longer. Give any task or event a colour of its own; whatever overlaps sits side by side, and the arrows go back to earlier weeks too. Calendars by link (Google, Outlook, Moodle, your school) show on every device, and Settings, under Account, exports everything as a table or a calendar file.","A calendar on your home screen","The new Calendar widget shows today by the hour: your meetings, events and tasks side by side, a line for now, and a circle to tick a task done. Press and hold the home screen, tap Widgets, and pick SkyTasks.","A task by voice, from the lock screen","Tap the SkyTasks button on the lock screen, in Control Centre or on the Action button, say the task, and it is in, with its day and time, without opening the app. Add the button: press and hold the lock screen, Customise, and pick SkyTasks.","Added: study for the exam \xb7 Thursday \xb7 16:00","Timetable, exams, and the week at a glance","Fill in your timetable once: lessons repeat every week and skip the holidays by themselves. Add an exam and the app proposes when to study in your free hours; every session is a floor of its building. The calendar now shows a day, 3 days with the free gaps, the week or the month, and tasks can be dragged into the gaps."],t.li)
